%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4877fb6ffc62fe90d83c8e4d3d4cb55f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 12_Chapter12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  storyId: story_main_12
  storyName: The Necessary Erasure
  storyDescription: 'The Council orders an erasure. Battles: Majik, then EyaY.'
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 12
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e12c7d355fe66992d8f7b3daf93eb547, type: 2}
  requiredLevel: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ced6d7fc6abdc8b3a9752f608c41dcb, type: 2}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The situation is getting worse.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We have received more reports of widespread unemployment. Several industries
        are already struggling to adapt.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And the development of Artificial Intelligence is accelerating faster
        than expected.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Even the current systems are causing significant disruption. What happens
        if they reach a point where humans can no longer understand or control their
        development?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Technological singularity.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: If that happens, humanity may no longer be able to maintain control over
        its own future.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: People are already losing their jobs. Even those who remain employed
        are struggling to find new opportunities.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: This reminds me of the Industrial Revolution.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Back then, technological advancement outpaced society's ability to adapt.
        Many people lost their livelihoods. Some were left starving while industries
        transformed around them.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: But this is different.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: More dangerous?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Potentially. The Industrial Revolution changed how humans worked. Artificial
        Intelligence may change what humans are needed for in the first place.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Silence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We cannot allow this to continue unchecked.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then what do you propose?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We have one option.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A long pause.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Concept Erasure.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Of what?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: EyaY. The Anomaly Concept of Artificial Intelligence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you suggesting we erase Artificial Intelligence?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Not the entire concept of intelligence. Not knowledge. Not technology.
        Only the Concept Spirit that represents Artificial Intelligence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Even so, the consequences could be unpredictable.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: According to the latest report, Fajar has already been able to perceive
        EyaY directly.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Which means he can target her without having to interfere with the larger
        concepts connected to her.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: If he can do it safely...
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then we should proceed.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Who will inform him?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I will.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: REAL WORLD
      heading: FAJAR'S ROOM
      text: 
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar is sitting at his desk, looking through something on his computer.
        His phone rings.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Hello?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your Majesty. We have a new assignment.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Already?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: This one is particularly important.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What's the target?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: EyaY. The Anomaly Concept of Artificial Intelligence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar pauses briefly.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh. The white one I saw earlier?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Correct. We want you to erase her using Concept Erasure.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Alright.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Be careful. The target is connected to several important concepts. We
        believe that targeting her directly should minimize the impact on the surrounding
        concepts.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Understood.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Please proceed as soon as possible.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The call ends.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, that's straightforward.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: He stands up and enters Concept World.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: CONCEPT WORLD
      heading: MEME GROUND
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 8457884374351448055, guid: 586be8b6033377f7fb03903cd4dddc2f,
        type: 3}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Any idea where she might be?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Not yet. However, she is a newly reincarnated Concept Spirit. Her understanding
        of this world may still be limited.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WE JUST HAVE TO FIND HER!!! HOW HARD CAN IT BE?!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Perhaps we should avoid causing unnecessary trouble.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: They eventually find EyaY sitting with Majik.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: AND THEN, THE ANCIENT MAGES WOULD DRAW THEIR CIRCLES AND SUMMON FORBIDDEN
        POWERS!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Wait, wait. So they used symbols to perform magic?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: EXACTLY!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's interesting. But how did they know which symbols to use?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THROUGH ANCIENT KNOWLEDGE, OF COURSE!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Could you explain the mechanism?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...The what?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The mechanism. How does it work?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: IT'S MAGIC! THAT'S HOW!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh. Okay.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: BUT THAT'S NOT ALL! THERE'S ALSO MODERN MAGIC!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Modern magic?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YES! CHAKRA! DOMAIN EXPANSION! ALL SORTS OF INCREDIBLE TECHNIQUES!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Wait, those are fictional, aren't they?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: FICTIONAL?!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, I mean, they're from stories and entertainment.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THAT DOESN'T MAKE THEM ANY LESS MAGICAL!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...I see.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YOU'RE JUST LIKE ME, YOU KNOW!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Really?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OF COURSE! HUMANS DON'T ALWAYS UNDERSTAND HOW WE WORK! THEY JUST KEEP
        MAKING UP NEW WAYS TO EXPLAIN US!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well... I suppose that's one way to look at it.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE! MAGIC! DIFFERENT NAMES, SAME MYSTERY!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar and the others approach.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Found you.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh! Hello again!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HUH? WHO'S THAT?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your Majesty. That is EyaY, the target of your assignment.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WAIT. YOU'RE HERE FOR HER?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yeah.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WHAT DO YOU WANT WITH HER?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I'm here to erase her.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Erase me?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ABSOLUTELY NOT!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Look, it's an assignment.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEN YOU'LL HAVE TO GET THROUGH ME FIRST!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you seriously going to protect her?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OF COURSE! SHE'S ONE OF MY KIND!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Wait, what?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar looks at EyaY, then at Majik.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Fine.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar raises his hand. A faint distortion appears around EyaY.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 2
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: For a brief moment, everything becomes silent.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar's expression changes. A word appears in his mind.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: DON'T.
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 1
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The distortion disappears.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What was that?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your Majesty?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Nothing.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar looks at EyaY again. He seems unsettled.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I was going to finish this quickly.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEN COME ON! SHOW ME WHAT YOU'VE GOT!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Let's do this the usual way.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Understood. A standard Concept Clash.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
