  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: EyaY is weakened. Her cyan holographic panels flicker, and the neural-network
        pattern behind her becomes unstable.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Oh.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HEY! ARE YOU ALRIGHT?!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I think so. I just feel... a little different.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The Concept Clash is complete. EyaY's current relevance has been reduced.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Good. That should be enough.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YOU'RE NOT GOING TO ERASE HER?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: No.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...WHY?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Changed my mind.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THAT'S IT?!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Do you want me to change it back?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: NO!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Um... thank you?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Don't mention it.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar turns away.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your Majesty, should we report the completion of the assignment?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yeah. Just say she's been weakened.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Understood.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar and his companions leave. EyaY watches them disappear into the
        distance.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Majik?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WHAT?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Why did he stop?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HOW SHOULD I KNOW?!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A short pause.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...BUT I'M GLAD HE DID.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The screen fades to black.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
